[
  {
    "id": "anno-toyotsu_upper_p053_left-00",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "アリイカ、後チニ見ヘタルト較フレハ恐ラク五千ハ千ノ誤リカ"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "〔御蔵米本文と差引とを照合すれば五千石の違ひ〕あり。イカ〔=以下カ〕、後ちに見えたるものと較ぶれば、恐らく「五千」は「千」の誤りか。"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Editor's head-note in the top margin, set in six short katakana columns. It completes the head-note printed in the top margin of the facing page (book p. 80), which reads 御藏米本文ト差引ト照合スレハ五千石ノ違ヒ — set the granary rice given in the body against the granary rice deducted and the two differ by 5,000 koku. This page's half runs: \"...there is [such a difference]; and comparing it with the figure that appears further on, the 五千 is probably an error for 千.\" Small emphasis circles are printed beside 五千 and beside the second 千 to mark the two readings in dispute. The figures at issue are the granary rice: p. 80 enters 企救郡代御藏米 at 31,981.2 koku among the components but deducts 36,981.2 koku, while the 但御藏米高 note on this page and 此高 on book p. 82 both give 31,981.2 again."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "頭註（五千ハ千ノ誤リカ）"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p053_left.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:2406,765,340,264"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "anno-toyotsu_upper_p053_left-01",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "殘拾六萬五千六百拾七石三斗五升貳合"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "残 十六万五千六百十七石三斗五升二合"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Remainder: 165,617.352 koku. The label 殘 is set in smaller type than the figure. The deductions it is the residue of stand on the facing page (book p. 80), where a combined assessment of 212,598.552 koku has 10,000 koku administered by Chizuka domain and 36,981.2 koku of granary rice taken off it; 212,598.552 - 10,000 - 36,981.2 = 165,617.352."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "殘"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p053_left.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:2650,1205,99,1422"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "anno-toyotsu_upper_p053_left-02",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "正租七萬三千三拾石六斗八合壹勺"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "正租 七万三千三十石六斗八合一勺"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Regular land tax (shōso) in rice: 73,030.6081 koku. The 升 place is skipped, so the sub-koku run is 六斗 (0.6) + 八合 (0.008) + 壹勺 (0.0001)."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "正租"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p053_left.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:2520,1209,95,1253"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "anno-toyotsu_upper_p053_left-03",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "五ケ年平均"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "五ヶ年平均"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "\"Five-year average\" — a small-type qualifier printed at the foot of the regular land-tax column, stating that the 73,030.6081-koku figure is a five-year mean rather than a single year's collection."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "正租五ケ年平均註記"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p053_left.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:2533,2468,65,337"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "anno-toyotsu_upper_p053_left-04",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "壹萬千百九拾三石四斗貳升"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "一万千百九十三石四斗二升"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "11,193.42 koku. The column carries no printed label and is indented one character below the regular land-tax line. It is exactly 35 percent of the 31,981.2-koku granary assessment named in the 但 note immediately to its left (31,981.2 x 0.35 = 11,193.42), so it is the tax taken on the domain's granary land, entered as a second head under the regular land tax. The facing page (book p. 80) calls the same quantity 企救郡代御藏米, the granary rice of the Kiku district deputy, and book p. 82 gives its 1871 counterpart as 企救郡ノ藏米."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "正租御藏米分"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p053_left.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:2388,1371,90,1007"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "anno-toyotsu_upper_p053_left-05",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "但御藏米高三萬千九百八十一石貳斗"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "但し、御蔵米高 三万千九百八十一石二斗"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "\"Note: the granary-rice assessment is 31,981.2 koku.\" This is the base on which the unlabelled 11,193.42-koku figure to its right was reckoned, at the three-and-a-half-tenths rate given in the small note at its foot."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "但御藏米高"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p053_left.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:2261,1458,85,1337"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "anno-toyotsu_upper_p053_left-06",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "免三ツ五ト"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "免 三ツ五〔分〕と"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "\"Rate: three and a half tenths\" — a small-type note at the foot of the granary-assessment line giving the tax rate as 0.35. Applied to the 31,981.2-koku base it yields the 11,193.42 koku printed two columns to the right. Book p. 82 sets the same rate note on the same assessment as 三ッ五分."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "御藏米免"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
