      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "（○辛未十月二十四日の調査によると"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "\"(According to the survey of the 24th day of the 10th month of the kanoto-hitsuji year\" — Meiji 4/10/24, i.e. 6 December 1871, some four months after the abolition of the domains. The opening parenthesis brackets the six red-ink lines; the closing parenthesis is printed at the end of the sixth line on book p. 82. The small circle is a bullet opening the note, not a domain marker."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "辛未十月廿四日調査註"
