      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "七万六千九百七十七石二升七合四勺　正雑"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "76,977.0274 koku, labelled 正雜 (\"regular and miscellaneous\") in a separate two-character run below the figure. Arithmetic on the 1871 block: 1,250 (reward grant) + 11,193.42 (granary rice) + 76,977.0274 = 89,420.4474, the current-rice total. The granary-rice term is printed as the fifth red-ink line on book p. 82, where it is set as 11,193.44 and leaves the block 0.02 koku over; 11,193.42, the figure printed on this page and equal to 31,981.2 x 0.35, closes it exactly."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "正雜"
      }
